  "reason": "The 38 frozen lesson rules preserve six original and 32 current lesson identities. Durable lesson.completed rows serve as local unlock receipts without a duplicated store. Current-lesson blocks are temporarily usable; unsupported versions fail closed. Native toolbox and keyboard creation are disabled for locked kinds, while code drafts remain intact and the session blocks running/submitting locked IR or detached blocks. Advanced historical probes complete real prerequisite lessons in a peer page. Final-source 56 Chrome regression gates, fresh-lock controls, 32/140 real Rust executions and the complete frontend suite passed. Saved completion, quota and cross-tab checks follow on the registered assembly. No edit history or 13.5 work is included.",
